{"product_id":"regal-ai-pro-smartwatch-1","title":"Regal AI Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRegal AI Pro Smart Watch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.19\" AMOLED Display with 360×360 Resolution\u003c\/strong\u003e A 1.19-inch AMOLED screen at 360×360p renders text, watch faces, and workout stats in deep contrast and rich color. Choose from 8 different menu view styles, adjust brightness on the fly, switch themes, or leave the always-on display running so the time is there the moment you glance down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-in ChatGPT \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e The Regal AI Pro puts AI on your wrist. ChatGPT support plus voice assistant access means you can ask questions, get answers, and handle quick tasks without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.3 Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by the JL7013A6 chipset with Bluetooth 5.3 and a 10-meter range, the built-in speaker and microphone let you take calls straight from your wrist. Sync your contact book, browse call records, and get incoming call, message, and app notifications the moment they land.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Health \u0026amp; Wellness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e An HRS3600 sensor drives 24-hour heart rate monitoring alongside blood pressure, SpO2, and blood oxygen tracking. Sleep monitoring breaks down your night, stress tracking flags the tense days, and breathing training helps you reset. A DA267 accelerometer handles step counting and calorie tracking, and a dedicated menstrual cycle tracker rounds out the female health suite.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e Nine sports modes are built into the watch, with 100+ more available through the Zero Health app, covering running, cycling, indoor training, and far beyond. A sedentary reminder nudges you when you've been still too long, and a water reminder keeps you hydrated through the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5-Day Battery, 15-Day Standby\u003c\/strong\u003e A 260mAh polymer battery delivers 3-5 days of everyday use and up to 15 days on standby, recharging in about 2.5 hours through the included USB magnetic cable. Just snap it on, no fiddling with ports.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance \u0026amp; AiR Silicon Build\u003c\/strong\u003e An IP68 rating means rain, sweat, and hand-washing splashes are no problem. The AiR Silicon body keeps the whole watch at just 59.2g with a 44.52mm bezel dial and a 155.6×20mm strap that stays comfortable from morning to night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100+ Watch Faces, Plus Your Own\u003c\/strong\u003e Nine watch faces come preloaded, 100+ more wait in the Zero Health app, and DIY watch face support lets you set your own photo as the dial.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything Else You Reach For Daily\u003c\/strong\u003e A functional rotating crown makes navigation quick, and the essentials are all onboard: camera remote, music playback and control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, stopwatch and countdown, theater\/DND mode, split screen, find my phone, find my device, gesture-to-wake, and three built-in games (Young Bird, Sudoku, and Hampster). Firmware stays current through OTA updates.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel: Regal AI Pro\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChipset: JL7013A6 (single chip)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApp: Zero Health (Android \/ iOS)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.19 inch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 360×360p\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 8 styles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAndroid Requirement: 4.0 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiOS Requirement: 9.0 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBezel Dial Dimensions: 44.52mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Dimensions: 155.6 × 20mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: AiR Silicon\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 59.2g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMemory: 128Mb\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Sensor: HRS3600\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccelerometer \/ Pedometer: DA267\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpeaker: 1508\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: V5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Range: 10M\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrown \/ Encoder Function: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: Polymer battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Model: 851819\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 260mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: USB magnetic cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 3-5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 15 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 9 built-in, 100+ cloud, DIY supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 9 built-in, 100+ cloud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-in Games: 3 (Young Bird, Sudoku, Hampster)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFirmware Updates: OTA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDefault Language: English\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupported Languages: Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, German, Korean, Spanish, Japanese, French, Russian, Arabic, Ukrainian, Italian, Portuguese\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGPS: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNFC: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnimated Watch Faces: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Storage on Watch: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTWS Pairing: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThird-Party App Store Support: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Functions\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Oxygen Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalorie Consumption\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChatGPT\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; Call Records\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContact Book Sync\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eText Message \u0026amp; Incoming Call Notifications\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Playback via Watch Speaker\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control from Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlashlight\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalculator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopwatch \/ Countdown\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheater \/ DND Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSplit Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlways-On Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Brightness Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheme Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGesture Wake Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrink Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFind My Device \/ Find My Phone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal AI Pro?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal AI Pro brings a sharp 1.19\" AMOLED display, Bluetooth 5.3 calling, a full health sensor suite, and built-in ChatGPT together in a 59.2g IP68 body you can wear through workouts, work days, and sleep. With 3-5 days of battery, 100+ sports modes, 100+ watch faces, and a rotating crown that makes it all easy to reach, it's a smart watch for people who want their calls, their health data, and their AI assistant in one place, right on their wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":51405833306390,"sku":"23476","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Gold","offer_id":51405833339158,"sku":"23475","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":51405833404694,"sku":"23473","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":51405833371926,"sku":"23477","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Green","offer_id":51405833273622,"sku":"23474","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_3_fab3da1c-eadf-4ddc-822b-e50eda55631a.webp?v=1786015100","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/regal-ai-pro-smartwatch-1","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}